# Job labeling

- Auto labels must include value, confidence, evidence/reason, source=auto, needs_review.
- If `label_source=manual`, do not overwrite unless user explicitly forces override.
- Hard eligibility only for citizenship, clearance, return-to-school conflict, start-date/auth conflict, unacceptable remote, explicit degree/grad-year block.
- Never set hard_eligibility=ineligible solely for sponsorship.
- Pursuit lanes: core / broad / practice.
